WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,890
Is he a classmate of Xiang University?

2
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:05,890
Well, how many people have you gathered here?

3
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:07,890
Only three knives were opened out of dozens

4
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:09,890
How many days can I eat to survive?

5
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:10,890
Who has the final say

6
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:12,890
I'll stop it for now

7
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:18,990
I was caught, please leave me alone.

8
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:20,990
Find me a room and lock it up

9
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:21,990
Better take a rest first

10
00:00:21,990 --> 00:00:23,990
They all said don’t go out and fight.

11
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:25,310
Just wait until the official comes

12
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:27,370
What to do if someone dies?

13
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:29,560
Where did he get the fake one?

14
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:37,990
I just solved it before coming here

15
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:40,090
A senior student who mutated after being captured

16
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:42,090
Can people survive this virus?

17
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:43,340
I don't know

18
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:44,340
But I got through it

19
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:46,440
Maybe it will become stronger

20
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:48,440
Don't wait until the last step

21
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:50,440
Listen to what others say

22
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,790
Regret

23
00:00:52,790 --> 00:00:54,920
To deny the past self

24
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,920
Fear is a biological instinct

25
00:00:56,920 --> 00:00:57,920
And courage

26
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:59,950
It is the hymn of mankind
